# ARM C++ Temperature Monitor — Project Log

## Project Goal

Build a bare-metal C++ temperature monitoring system using an ARM Cortex-M microcontroller.

Target:

* MCU: STM32F103C8 (ARM Cortex-M3)
* Simulator: Wokwi
* Language: Modern C++
* Sensor: I2C temperature sensor (TMP102 planned)
* Output:

  * LED alarm when temperature exceeds threshold
  * UART temperature logging

Final architecture:

```
Application
    |
Temperature Monitor
    |
Device Drivers
    |
GPIO | I2C | UART | Timer
    |
STM32 Registers
    |
ARM Cortex-M3
```

