```

The project now supports ARM cross compilation.

Build commands:

Configure:

```
cmake \
-S . \
-B build \
-G Ninja \
-DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=arm-gcc-toolchain.cmake
```

Build:

```
cmake --build build
```

