# 5. Bare-Metal Firmware Files Added

Created:

```
src/main.cpp

startup/startup_stm32f103.s

linker/stm32f103.ld
```

Purpose:

## Linker Script

Defines MCU memory:

```
FLASH:
0x08000000
64KB

RAM:
0x20000000
20KB
```

## Startup Assembly

Creates:

* Vector table
* Initial stack pointer
* Reset Handler

Boot sequence:

```
Power ON

↓

Vector Table

↓

Reset_Handler

↓

SystemInit()

↓

main()
```

